{
  "name": "opportunity-matches",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## opportunity-matches\nKeeps only the opportunities this student is **eligible** for (database rules, no AI), then the course model **ranks** the best ones with *why you qualify* and *what you're missing*. Saves the list to `opportunity_matches`, logs `ai_runs`, replies to the website. Free: top 5. Pro/Premium: top 8.\n\n**After import:**\n1. **Auth check** → choose `cc-auth-and-limits` from the list.\n2. **Course model** → `CC Model`. **Get eligible** and **Save matches** → `CC Supabase service`.\n3. Needs `supabase/07_matches_and_emails.sql` to have been run.\n4. Settings → Error workflow → `cc-error-handler` (once it exists).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "82eb02fb-0d7a-4af9-94c9-e1aabe04f6e5",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Privacy guardrail\nGender, nationality and age are used **only** inside the database eligibility check (`matches_for_user`) and are never sent to the model. **Build prompt** passes only study details, CGPA, city, skills and experience.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b9fe4701-bee4-4360-9287-47667b9b2289",
      "name": "Privacy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2064,
        -260
      ]
    },
